Subject: Share original frontend presentation camera and time waits
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Share exact callback-consumption and single-float wait subtraction from original
presentation services44/48. The console dispatcher retains StopWithUndo; the
native original interpreter supplies typed retained camera/scene services.
Concrete title/main handlers, movies, audio and boot readiness remain separate.

diff --git a/include/Game/FE/FrontendTransitionSteps.h b/include/Game/FE/FrontendTransitionSteps.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..40ed0f2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/Game/FE/FrontendTransitionSteps.h
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+#ifndef FRONTEND_TRANSITION_STEPS_H
+#define FRONTEND_TRANSITION_STEPS_H
+
+// Original FrontEndPresentation service44 consumes the actual camera callback
+// once. Service48 subtracts this Update's delta immediately on every retry.
+inline bool FrontendPresentationWaitCamera(bool& finished)
+{
+    if (!finished)
+        return true;
+    finished = false;
+    return false;
+}
+inline bool FrontendPresentationWaitTime(float& wait, float delta)
+{
+    wait -= delta;
+    if (wait > 0.0f)
+        return true;
+    wait = 0.0f;
+    return false;
+}
+#endif
